    "# Session 1: Differentiable Programming with HIPS/Autograd\n",
    "\n",
    "<div class=\"alert alert-block alert-warning\" style=\"background-color: rgb(236,176,146); border: 2px solid rgb(213,104,79); color: rgb(64,64,64);\">\n",
    "    \n",
